# Negative-control mutant — the subscription-type toggle replaces, never merges (R38 item 1)
#
# Assertion it attacks:
# contract-products-filter-wire.test.ts, "One-time, after Subscriptions,
# replaces the narrowing and never sends both" — after Subscriptions then
# One-time, the wire carries filter[billing_cycle_days|eq]=0 and no
# filter[billing_cycle_days|neq].
